SerMon — Project Review & Grade
Overall this is a strong, well-above-average portfolio project that clearly demonstrates senior-leaning backend and DevOps skills (event-driven CDC architecture, multi-datasource persistence, time-series modeling, JWT/RBAC security, full containerization). The main gap is that the headline feature — the metrics monitoring pipeline — is designed at the infrastructure/DB layer but not yet wired end-to-end in application code, and test coverage is minimal. There are also a couple of real correctness/security issues worth fixing before you show this to interviewers.
